{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09629","headline":"太一石鳖崖口潭旧庐招王学士 · 岑参","name":"太一石鳖崖口潭旧庐招王学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骤雨鸣淅沥，飕飀谿谷寒。\n碧潭千余尺，下见蛟龙蟠。\n石门吞衆流，绝岸呀层峦。\n幽趣倏万变，奇观非一端。\n偶逐干禄徒，十年皆小官。\n抱板寻旧圃，弊庐临迅湍。\n君子满清朝，小人思挂冠。\n酿酒漉松子，引泉通竹竿。\n何必濯沧浪，不能钓严滩。\n此地可遗老，劝君来考盘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}